# Telecom Add customer

## Add customer
* Open Guru99 Telecom application
* When user clicks Add Customer option in the home page
* When user checks "Pending" radio button for Background Check
* When user enters the First name as "John" in Billing address
* When user enters the Last name as "Abrahams" in Billing address
* When user enters the Email as "john.abrahams@example.com" in Billing address
* When user enters the Address as "123 Main Street" in Billing address
* When user enters the Mobile Number as "1234567890" in Billing address
* Pause execution for "20" seconds
//* When user clicks Submit button